# controltogether
===
 Play your games together, from anywhere. Share your PS5 or PS4, a game on your computer, or your Xbox: friends join with a link, in the app or a web browser, and play along with their own controllers. Voice chat, webcams, OBS overlay and Twitch streaming built in. Windows, macOS, Linux..
